### 查询医院
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hospitals
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 查询医院 1 的科室
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hospitals/1/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 查询科室 1 的医生
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/departments/1/doctors
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 查询医生 1 的可用号源
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctors/1/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 提交预约，首次运行使用号源 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduleId": 1
}

> {%
client.global.set("appointmentOrderId", response.body.data.appointmentOrderId);
client.global.set("paymentOrderId", response.body.data.paymentOrderId);
%}

### 查询刚创建的预约，确认返回 paymentOrderId 与 paymentStatus
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{appointmentOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 模拟支付成功
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/{{paymentOrderId}}/simulate-success
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 再次查询预约，确认状态为 CONFIRMED 与 PAID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{appointmentOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 查询自己的预约单，确认每条记录包含支付信息
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/my
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
